      "name": "P V Anthony",
      "created_at": "2025-10-09T14:55:25.388Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Trying to learn how to run the following python script in frappe-bench directory.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">import frappe\nimport json\nfrom frappe.utils import flt\nfrom frappe import _\nimport requests\nfrom datetime import datetime, time\nfrom frappe.utils import (\n    add_days,\n    cint,\n    create_batch,\n    cstr,\n    flt,\n    formatdate,\n    get_datetime,\n    get_number_format_info,\n    getdate,\n    now,\n    nowdate,\n)\n\ndef my_function():\n    print(\"Hello, World!\")\n\n</code></pre>\n<p>Tried to run the above script using the command below. The above script was saved in file named python_script.py</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">bench --site erpnext.domain.com execute python_script.my_function\n\n</code></pre>\n<p>Does not seem to work. Any advice?</p>\n<p>Did I miss some steps?</p>",
